[en.FOCUS_C04_CRYSTAL_APPROVE]
Approval for Sale

[en.FOCUS_C04_CRYSTAL_APPROVE_desc]
Since the crystal mine has already started circulating and has been recognized by the market, we should approve this transaction. However, the dividends of developing the mining industry cannot all go to those speculators. We need to charge a high mining tax to ensure that the residents of Stratusburg and the autonomous government have a share.

[zh.FOCUS_C04_CRYSTAL_APPROVE]
批准销售

[zh.FOCUS_C04_CRYSTAL_APPROVE_desc]
既然水晶矿已经开始流通并且的到了市场的认可，那么我们就应该批准这次交易。只不过，发展采矿业的红利不能全部归于那些投机商，我们需要收取高额的开采税来确保层云堡居民与自治领政府有所收获。

